#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_modify.rst:5
msgid "Modify conductor"
msgstr "修改导体"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_modify.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech draws by default a `conductor`_ minimizing the horizontal and "
"vertical lines. Changing the route of the `conductor`_ for a clear "
"understanding of the `schema`_ is some times necessary. QElectroTech allows "
"modifying the route."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，QElectroTech 绘制 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 时会尽量减少水平线和垂直线。为了清晰理解 `原理图 "
"<schema_>`_ ，有时需要更改 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 的路径。QElectroTech 允许修改路径。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_modify.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech modify conductor"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 修改导体"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_modify.rst:16
msgid "To modify the route of a `conductor`_:"
msgstr "要修改 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 的路径："

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_modify.rst:18
msgid "`Select the conductor`_ which route should be modified."
msgstr "`选择要修改路径的导体 <Select the conductor_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_modify.rst:19
msgid "Press on a control point, blue points, from the `conductor`_ selected."
msgstr "按住选中的 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 上的一个控制点（蓝色点）。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/conductor/conductor_modify.rst:20
msgid ""
"Without releasing the control point, displace the control point horizontally"
" or vertically until desired position."
msgstr "不要松开控制点，将其水平或垂直拖动到所需位置。"
